// viewerKey is the unexported context key type the carrier pair stashes and
// reads a request's Viewer under. It lives in access (not api) so that
// cmd-side closures and test seams that legitimately hold a context can read
// the viewer back — the key is unexported, so only this package can construct
// it, and the ONLY production stasher is api's viewerFor (l6-accounts D9:
// one key, one seam).
